  GridBoxItemSize->{
   "Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}]], "Text", \
"BlockQuote",
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"634843c8-bddd-2f43-b291-47026ce7ca17"],

Cell["in a way that is: ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b5f132c2-649e-c34c-8102-14b449eca27e"],

Cell["mathematically explicit", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"82b6eb76-1a95-5b43-a1c2-c990e140bb48"],

Cell["separated into assumptions vs derived consequences", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"3f4237a9-d362-1140-8d34-2b5be7c034df"],

Cell["testable in Wolfram Language", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"8e6ca164-6c0b-dd4e-af19-319677e014f6"],

Cell["\<\
comparable to modern PDE, variational, operator, and measurement workflows\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"3e399d6c-f034-514a-b854-eb84150eb274"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "careful about what is ",
 StyleBox["postulated",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " versus what actually ",
 StyleBox["follows",
  FontWeight->Bold]
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"e0da55c8-93b4-b04c-ad6a-aedd3b0448ac"],

Cell["It also documents how to test the idea against: ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7a41e254-f737-f845-bc46-3c0c3fb75c10"],

Cell["\<\
early-universe style activation / symmetry-breaking analogies\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"a6fe4949-9659-e64a-92dd-61bab764250a"],

Cell["double-slit style measurement-induced pattern changes", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"fc1f541c-1fdb-574d-b403-d15adb144b8c"],

Cell["scale dependence of observation kernels", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"3da1f43c-3b6b-e94e-b955-240d141b3af7"],

